WEBVTT

00:12:58.836 --> 00:13:01.036
but we’ve added women.

00:13:01.036 --> 00:13:02.836
And we have more than half women now,

00:13:02.876 --> 00:13:04.716
and we've added the second generation.

00:13:04.716 --> 00:13:07.956
So we started out with 724 people.

00:13:07.996 --> 00:13:11.436
Now we have over 2,000 people in our study

00:13:11.476 --> 00:13:13.996
and we're still collecting data today.

00:13:14.476 --> 00:13:15.636
WPR: Wow.

00:13:15.676 --> 00:13:18.756
And I know in the book you talk about ...

00:13:18.996 --> 00:13:23.596
how the advice you offer,

00:13:23.636 --> 00:13:26.556
the wisdom you offer is not just
drawn from your own study

00:13:26.596 --> 00:13:28.556
because of some of what you've suggested,

00:13:28.596 --> 00:13:32.836
that you're just now starting to bring
women and different generations.